# This repo publishes the MOD ONLY.
# The working tree also holds upstream clones (CDDA/, CBN/), the stale MoM/
# archive, and the private porter pipeline (tools/, docs/, specs) -- none of
# which are published. Allowlist rather than blocklist, so nothing new that
# lands at the repo root gets committed by accident.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/mindovermatter_bn/

# Junk that could appear inside the mod tree itself
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.tmp
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
